# Close-up aerial imagery (Esri World Imagery) for the live site.
# 1. Create a free ArcGIS Location Platform account: https://location.arcgis.com/sign-up/
# 2. Create an API key with the "Basemaps" privilege and restrict it to your site's domain (HTTP referrer).
# 3. Copy this file to .env.local, paste the key below, then build.
# Without a key the production build streams nothing extra: the map stays on Sentinel-2 (dev uses Esri's public endpoint for testing).
VITE_ARCGIS_KEY=

# Street-level "Walk here" photos (Mapillary, free). Create a free account at mapillary.com, then
# Dashboard → Developers → Register application; copy its *Client Token* (starts with MLY|) here.
# Without it the "Walk here" button is simply not shown.
VITE_MAPILLARY_TOKEN=
